  "pageSize": 50,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08860",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 351,
      "bookHadithIndex": 351,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah reported the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) as saying:Whoever takes bath due to sexual defilement on Friday and goes out (for Friday prayer), is treated like one who offers a camel as sacrifice; he who goes out in the second instance as one who offers a cow; he who goes out in the third instance is treated as one who offers horned cow ; he who goes out in the fourth instance is treated as one who offers hen ; he who goes out in the fifth instance is treated as one who offers an egg. When the Imam comes out (for sermon), the angels too attend to listen to the sermon",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-351-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-351-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-351-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-351-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari (881) Sahih Muslim (850)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08861",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 352,
      "bookHadithIndex": 352,
      "text": "Aishah said:The people (mostly) were workers and they would come for Friday prayer in the same condition, so it was said to them: If only you were to perform Ghusl",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-352-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-352-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-352-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari (903) Sahih Muslim (847)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08862",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 353,
      "bookHadithIndex": 353,
      "text": "Amr b. Abi 'Amr and 'Ikrimah reported:Some people of Iraq came and said: Ibn 'Abbas, do you regard taking a bath on Friday as obligatory ? He said: No, it is only a means of cleanliness, and is better for one who washes oneself. Anyone who does not take a bath, it is not essential for him. I inform you how the bath (on Friday) commenced. The people were poor and used to wear woolen clothes, and would carry loads on their backs. Their mosque was small and its rood was lowered down. It was a sort of trellis of vine. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) once came out on a hot day and the people perspired profusely in the woolen clothes so much so that foul smell emitted from them and it caused trouble to each other. When the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) found the foul smell, he said: O people, when this day (Friday) comes, you should take bath and every one should anoint the best oil and perfume one has. Ibn 'Abbas then said: Then Allah, the Exalted, provided wealth (to the people) and they wore clothes other than the woolen, and were spared from work, and their mosque became vast. The foul smell that caused trouble to them became non-existent",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-353-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-353-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-353-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-353-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08863",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 354,
      "bookHadithIndex": 354,
      "text": "Narrated Samurah: If any one of you performs ablution (on Friday) that is all right; and if any of you takes a bath, that is better",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-354-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-354-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-354-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-354-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08864",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 355,
      "bookHadithIndex": 355,
      "text": "Narrated Qays ibn Asim: I came to the Prophet (ﷺ) with the intention of embracing Islam. He commanded me to take a bath with water (boiled with) the leaves of the lote-tree",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-355-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-355-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-355-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08865",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 356,
      "bookHadithIndex": 356,
      "text": "Uthaim b. Kulaib reported from his father (Kuthair) on the authority of his grandfather (Kulaib) that he came to the Prophet (ﷺ):I have embraced Islam. The Prophet (ﷺ) said to him: Remove from yourself the hair that grew during of unbelief, saying \"shave them\". He further says that another person (other than the grandfather of 'Uthaim) reported to him that the Prophet (ﷺ) said to another person who accompanied him: Remove from yourself the hair that grew during the period of unbelief and get yourself circumcised",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-356-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-356-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-356-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-356-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08866",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 357,
      "bookHadithIndex": 357,
      "text": "Mu'adhah said that 'Aishah was asked about (washing) the clothes of a menstruating woman smeared with blood. She said:She should wash it; in case mark is not removed she should change it by applying some yellow color. I had three menstruations together while I lives with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), but I did not wash my clothes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-357-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-357-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-357-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08867",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 358,
      "bookHadithIndex": 358,
      "text": "Aishah said:Each of us (wives of the Prophet) had only one clothe in which she would menstruate. Whenever it was smeared with blood, she would moisten it with her saliva and scratch it with saliva",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-358-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-358-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-358-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08868",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 359,
      "bookHadithIndex": 359,
      "text": "Narrated Umm Salamah, Ummul Mu'minin: Bakkar ibn Yahya said that his grandmother narrated to him: I entered upon Umm Salamah. A woman from the Quraysh asked her about praying with the clothes which a woman wore while she menstruated. Umm Salamah said: We would menstruate in the lifetime of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). Then each one of us refrained (from prayer) during menstrual period. When she was purified, she would look at the clothe in which she menstruated. If it were smeared with blood, we would wash it and pray with it; if there were nothing in it, we would leave it and that would not prevent us from praying with it (the same clothe). As regards the woman who had plaited hair - sometimes each of us had plaited hair - when she washed, she would not undo the hair. She would instead pour three handfuls of water upon her head. When she felt moisture in the roots of her hair, she would rub them. Then she would pour water upon her whole body",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-359-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-359-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-359-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08869",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 360,
      "bookHadithIndex": 360,
      "text": "Asma' daughter of Abu Bakr said:I heard a woman asking the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ): What should any of us to with her clothe (in which she menstruated) when she becomes purified ? Can she pray in that (clothe) ? He said: She should see; if she finds blood in it, she should scratch it with some water and (in case of doubt) sprinkle upon it (some water) and pray so long as she does not find (any blood)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-360-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-360-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-360-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-360-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0886a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 361,
      "bookHadithIndex": 361,
      "text": "Asma' daughter of Abu Bakr said:A woman asked the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ): Messenger of Allah, what do you think if the clothe of any of us smeared with the blood of menstruation; what should she do ? He said: If (the clothe of) any of you is smeared with blood of menstruation, she should scratch it; then she should sprinkle water upon it and then she may pray",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-361-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-361-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-361-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-361-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari (307) Sahih Muslim (291)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0886b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 362,
      "bookHadithIndex": 362,
      "text": "This tradition has been transmitted by Hisham through a different chain of narrators to the same effect:Rub it off (with a stone), and then scratch it (with finger) by pouring water, then sprinkle water upon it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-362-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-362-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-362-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-362-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0886c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 363,
      "bookHadithIndex": 363,
      "text": "Narrated Umm Qays daughter of Mihsan: I asked the Prophet (ﷺ) about the blood of menstruation on the clothe. He said: Erase it off with a piece of wood and then wash it away with water and the leaves of the lote-tree",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-363-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-363-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-363-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-363-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0886d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 364,
      "bookHadithIndex": 364,
      "text": "Aishah said:One of us would have a shirt in which she would menstruate and in it she became sexually defiled. Then if she ever saw any drop of blood in it, she would rub it off by applying her saliva",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-364-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-364-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-364-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-364-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0886e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 365,
      "bookHadithIndex": 365,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah reported that Khawlah daughter of Yasar came to the Prophet (ﷺ) and said:Messenger of Allah, I have only one clothe and I menstruate in it, how should I do ? He said: When you are purified, wash it and pray in it. She asked: If the blood is not removed, (then what) ? He said: It is enough for you to wash the blood, its mark will not do any harm to you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-365-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-365-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-365-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0886f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 366,
      "bookHadithIndex": 366,
      "text": "Narrated Umm Habibah: Mu'awiyah ibn AbuSufyan asked his sister Umm Habibah, the wife of the Prophet (ﷺ): Would the apostle of Allah (ﷺ) pray in the clothe in which he had an intercourse? She said: Yes, when he would not see any impurity in it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-366-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-366-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-366-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-366-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08870",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 367,
      "bookHadithIndex": 367,
      "text": "Narrated Aisha, Ummul Mu'minin: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would not pray in our wrappers or in our quilts. Ubaydullah said: My father (Mu'adh) doubted this",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-367-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-367-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-367-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-367-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08871",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 368,
      "bookHadithIndex": 368,
      "text": "Aishah said:The Prophet (ﷺ) would not in our quilts. Hammad said: I heard Sa'id b. Abi Sadaqah say: I asked Muhammad (b. Sirin) about it. He did not narrate it to me, but said: I heard it a long time ago and I do not know whom I heard it. I do not know whether I heard it from a trustworthy person or not. Make an inquiry about it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-368-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-368-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-368-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-368-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08872",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 369,
      "bookHadithIndex": 369,
      "text": "Maimunah reported:The Prophet (ﷺ) prayed on a sheet of cloth put on by one of his wives who was menstruating. He was praying while (a part of) it was upon him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-369-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-369-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-369-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-369-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08873",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 370,
      "bookHadithIndex": 370,
      "text": "Aishah said:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would pray at night while I lay by his side during my menstrual period. A sheet of cloth would be partly on me and partly on him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-370-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-370-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-370-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim (514)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08874",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 371,
      "bookHadithIndex": 371,
      "text": "Hammam b. al-Harith reported, he has a sexual dream when he was staying with 'Aishah. The slave girl of 'Aishah saw him while he was washing the mark of defilement, or he was washing his clothe. She informed 'Aishah who said:He witnessed me rubbing off the semen from the clothe of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). Abu Dawud said: Al-A'mash narrated it as narrated by al-Hakam",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-371-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-371-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-371-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-371-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim (288)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08875",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 372,
      "bookHadithIndex": 372,
      "text": "Aishah reported:I used to rub off the semen from the clothe of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). He would would pray in it. Abu Dawud said: Mughirah, Abu Ma'shar, and Wasil also narrated it to the same effect",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-372-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-372-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-372-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-372-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim (288)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08876",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 373,
      "bookHadithIndex": 373,
      "text": "Sulaiman b. Yasar reported:I heard 'Aishah say that she would wash semen from the clothe of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). She added: Then I would see a mark or marks (after washing)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-373-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-373-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-373-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-373-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari (229) Sahih Muslim (289)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08877",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 374,
      "bookHadithIndex": 374,
      "text": "Umm Qais daughter of Mihsan reported that she came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) with her little son who had not attained the age of eating food. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) seated him in his lap, and he urinated on his clothe. He sent for water and sprayed it (over his clothe) and did not wash it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-374-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-374-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-374-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari (223) Sahih Muslim (287)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08878",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 375,
      "bookHadithIndex": 375,
      "text": "Narrated Lubabah daughter of al-Harith: Al-Husayn ibn Ali was (sitting) in the lap of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). He passed water on him. I said: Put on (another) clothe, and give me your wrapper to wash. He said: The urine of a female child should be washed (thoroughly) and the urine of a male child should be sprinkled over",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-375-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-375-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-375-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-375-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08879",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 376,
      "bookHadithIndex": 376,
      "text": "Narrated AbusSamh: I used to serve the Prophet (ﷺ). Whenever he intended to wash himself, he would say: Turn your back towards me, So I would turn my back and hide him. (Once) Hasan or Husayn (may Allah be pleased with them) was brought to him and he passed water on his chest. I came to wash it. He said: It is only the urine of a female which should be washed; the urine of a male should be sprinkled over. 'Abbas (a narrator) said: Yahya b. al-Walid narrated the tradition to us. Abu Dawud said: He (Yahya) is Abu al-Za'ra'. Harun b. Tamim said on the authority of al-Hasan: All sorts of urine are equal",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-376-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-376-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-376-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0887a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 377,
      "bookHadithIndex": 377,
      "text": "Narrated Ali ibn AbuTalib: The urine of a female (child) should be washed and the urine of a male (child) should be sprinkled over until the age of eating",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-377-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-377-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-377-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0887b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 378,
      "bookHadithIndex": 378,
      "text": "Ali b. Abi Talib reported the Prophet (ﷺ) as saying:He narrated the tradition to the same effect, but he did not mention the words \"until the age of eating\". This version adds: Qatadah said: This is valid until the time they do not eat food; when they begin to eat, their urine should be washed",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-378-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-378-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-378-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0887c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 379,
      "bookHadithIndex": 379,
      "text": "Narrated Umm Salamah, Ummul Mu'minin: Al-Hasan reported on the authority of his mother that she was Umm Salamah pouring water on the urine of the male child until the age when he did not eat food. When he began to eat food, she would wash (his urine). And she would wash the urine of the female child",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-379-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-379-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-379-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0887d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 380,
      "bookHadithIndex": 380,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah reported:A bedouin entered the\tmosque while the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was sitting. He offered two rak'ahs of prayer, according to the version of Ibn 'Abdah. He then said: O Allah, have mercy on me and on Muhammad and do not have mercy on anyone along with us. The Prophet (ﷺ) said: You have narrowed down (a thing) that was broader. After a short while he passed a water in the corner of the mosque. The people rushed towards him. The Prophet (ﷺ) prevented them and said: You have been sent to facilitate and not create difficulties. Pour a bucket of water upon it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-380-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-380-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-380-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0887e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 381,
      "bookHadithIndex": 381,
      "text": "Narrated Abdullah ibn Ma'qil ibn Muqarrin: A bedouin prayed with the Prophet (ﷺ). He then narrated the tradition (No 0380) about urinating of that bedouin. This version adds: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: Remove the earth where he urinated and throw it away and pour water upon the place. Abu Dawud said: This is a mursal tradition (i.e. the narrator quotes the Prophet (ﷺ) directly, although he did not see him). Ibn Ma'qil did not see the Prophet (ﷺ)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-381-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-381-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-381-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-381-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f0887f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 382,
      "bookHadithIndex": 382,
      "text": "Ibn 'Umar said:I used to sleep in the mosque in the lifetime of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) when I was young and bachelor. The dogs would urinate frequently visit the mosque, and no one would sprinkle over it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-382-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-382-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-382-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-382-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari (174)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08880",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 383,
      "bookHadithIndex": 383,
      "text": "Narrated Umm Salamah, Ummul Mu'minin: The slave-mother of Ibrahim ibn AbdurRahman ibn Awf asked Umm Salamah, the wife of the Prophet (ﷺ): I am a woman having a long border of clothe and I walk in filthy place; (then what should I do?). Umm Salamah replied: The Messenger of Allah ( peace be upon him) said: What comes after it cleanses it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-383-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-383-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-383-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-383-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08881",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 384,
      "bookHadithIndex": 384,
      "text": "Narrated A woman of the Banu AbdulAshhal: She reported: I said Messenger of Allah, our road to the mosque has an unpleasant stench; what should we do when it is raining? He asked: Is there not a cleaner part after the filthy part of the road? She replied: Why not (there is one)! He said: It makes up for the other",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-384-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-384-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-384-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-384-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08882",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 385,
      "bookHadithIndex": 385,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah reported:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: When any one of you treads with his sandal upon an unclean place, the earth will render it purified",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-385-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-385-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-385-shuaibalarnaut",
          "name": "Shuaib Al Arnaut",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-385-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c493dd1a4c9c86f08883",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320",
      "bookIndex": 1,
      "hadithIndex": 386,
      "bookHadithIndex": 386,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah reported the tradition to the same effect from the Prophet (ﷺ):When any of you treads with his shoes upon something unclean, they will be purified with the earth",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-386-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1320-1-386-muhammadmuhyialdinabdulhamid",
          "name": "Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
